# RB-LINUX-012 — Linux Fleet Health Monitoring & Email Alerting

## Objective

Build and validate a reusable Bash-based Linux health-monitoring system capable of:

- Checking critical systemd services
- Checking listening TCP ports
- Monitoring filesystem utilization
- Monitoring memory utilization
- Detecting pending package updates
- Classifying system health
- Returning machine-readable exit codes
- Sending email alerts for abnormal conditions
- Detecting controlled service failures
- Supporting a Git → validation → deployment workflow

