## Health classifications

| Condition | Classification | Exit Code | Email |
|---|---|---:|---|
| All checks normal | HEALTHY | `0` | No |
| Administrative/resource warning | WARNING | `2` | Yes |
| Service/resource failure | CRITICAL | `1` | Yes |

Examples:

```text
HEALTHY
PASS: Service nginx is active
PASS: TCP port 80 is listening
PASS: Root filesystem utilization is 10%
```

```text
WARNING
WARN: Root filesystem utilization is 84%
```

```text
CRITICAL
FAIL: Service nginx is not active
FAIL: TCP port 80 is not listening
```

