# Functional testing performed

We established a known-good baseline on `devops02`.

The script successfully detected:

```text
ssh
nginx
noc-app
docker
containerd
qemu-guest-agent
```

and TCP:

```text
22
80
9100
```

We deliberately stopped nginx:

```bash
sudo systemctl stop nginx
```

The monitor correctly detected:

```text
FAIL: Service nginx is not active
FAIL: TCP port 80 is not listening

Failures Detected: 2
Overall Status: CRITICAL
```

We restored the service:

```bash
sudo systemctl start nginx
```

and the monitor returned to:

```text
Failures Detected: 0
Overall Status: HEALTHY
```

This demonstrated the complete operational cycle:

```text
KNOWN GOOD
    ↓
CONTROLLED FAILURE
    ↓
DETECTION
    ↓
ALERT
    ↓
INVESTIGATION
    ↓
REMEDIATION
    ↓
VERIFICATION
```

