# Email alerting

The existing `msmtp` infrastructure was reused.

Healthy systems remain quiet:

```text
HEALTHY
   ↓
exit 0
   ↓
No email
```

Abnormal systems generate alerts:

```text
WARNING / CRITICAL
        ↓
Build report
        ↓
msmtp
        ↓
support@4techworks.com
        ↓
Management phone notification
```

Alerts include host identity, overall status, warning/failure counts, and captured warning/failure messages.

